# Personal Portfolio Website

## About
This is my personal portfolio website created to showcase my education, skills, projects, achievements, experience, resume, and contact information.

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Projects

### 1. Blood Bank Management System
A website for managing blood donation information and blood bank services.

### 2. Student Management System
A Python-based application for managing student records.

### 3. Spam Email Detection
A Machine Learning project that classifies emails as spam or not spam.

## Features
- Responsive portfolio design
- About Me section
- Skills section
- Projects section
- Education section
- Achievements and Certifications
- Experience and Internship
- Resume
- Contact form

## Deployment
The portfolio website is deployed using Vercel.

